017","armor":"WP1031705","helmet":"WP1012802"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10160","city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[81,72,87,56,88,89],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"110","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10017","armor":"WP1031705","helmet":"WP1012802"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1001060","name":{"zh":"米巫星劫","en":"Star Calamity of the Rice Shaman"},"year":"206","month":"3","desc":{"zh":"张琪瑛专注于普及五斗米道，远近驰名。张琪瑛一日观察到天璇星星象异常，决定探索这现象的成因......\n\n禁忌条件：主角为张琪瑛、张玉兰时无法触发。\n\n亲历条件：【张琪瑛存活】、【张玉兰死亡】、【与张琪瑛关系等级至少为3级】\n\n逆天改命：【收张琪瑛为家将，复活张玉兰并收为家将】","en":"Zhang Qiying dedicated herself to spreading the Way of the Five Pecks of Rice, earning renown far and wide. One day, Zhang Qiying observed anomalous celestial signs in the Tianxuan star, and resolved to explore the cause of this phenomenon...\n\n\n\nIneligible Conditions: Cannot trigger if the protagonist is Zhang Qiying or Zhang Yulan.\n\n\n\nParticipation Requirements: 【Zhang Qiying is alive】, 【Zhang Yulan is dead】, 【Relationship level with Zhang Qiying is at least Level 3】\n\n\n\nDefy Fate: 【Recruit Zhang Qiying as a Retainer, and revive Zhang Yulan to recruit her as a Retainer】"}}],"biography":{"zh":"汉末名士张鲁之女，并受父亲影响，深信以道教为基础的五斗米神教。在张鲁向曹操投降后，亦随之降魏，并嫁给了曹操之子曹宇。据传在琪瑛成人后，多担任情报工作，帮助父亲张鲁在汉末诸侯之间周旋。","tc":"漢末名士張魯之女，并受父親影響，深信以道教為基礎的五斗米神教。在張魯向曹操投降后，亦隨之降魏，并嫁給了曹操之子曹宇。據傳在琪瑛成人后，多擔任情報工作，幫助父親張魯在漢末諸侯之間周旋。","en":"The daughter of Zhang Lu, a noted figure of the late Han. Influenced by her father, she was a devout believer in the Way of the Five Pecks of Rice, a Daoist faith. After Zhang Lu surrendered to Cao Cao, she accompanied him in submission to Wei and was married to Cao Cao's son Cao Yu. It is said that after reaching adulthood, Qiying often engaged in intelligence work, helping her father Zhang Lu navigate among the warlords of the late Han.","jp":"後漢末の名士・張魯の娘。父の影響を受け、道教を基盤とする五斗米神教を深く信仰していた。張魯が曹操に降伏した後はこれに従って魏に降り、曹操の子である曹宇に嫁いだ。成人後は情報工作を多く担い、後漢末の諸侯の間で父・張魯が立ち回るのを補佐したと伝えられている。","kr":"후한 말의 명사 장로의 딸로, 아버지의 영향을 받아 도교를 바탕으로 한 오두미신교를 깊이 신봉했습니다. 장로가 조조에게 항복한 후 함께 위나라에 항복하였으며, 조조의 아들 조우에게 시집갔습니다. 전해지는 바에 따르면 장기영은 성인이 된 후 주로 정보 업무를 맡아, 아버지 장로가 한말의 제후들 사이에서 원만히 주선하도록 도왔다고 합니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ11009","remark":"","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"琪瑛","nameTc":"琪瑛","nameEn":"Qiying","nameJp":"琪瑛","nameKr":"기영","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"张琪瑛","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"212","city":"CS1036","gender":"1","rule":"81","force":"72","wise":"87","politics":"56","charm":"88","will":"89","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"9","wiseTalent":"11","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"11","willTalent":"11","weaponMaster":"19/19/73/19/19/74/50/19","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1003505;1002102","warSoul":"S1000605;S1003005","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1004205","warSoulPoint":"6600","battleSoulPoint":"5200","debateSoulPoint":"7600","strategy":"","strategy2":"1001305","professions":"4/2/2/3/0/0/3/3/4/0/2/2/1/4/0/3/2/3/1/5/4/1/4/1","attribute2":"86/79/90/56/88/93","morality":"4","compatible":"28","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"184","show":"197","death":"237","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"6","weapon":"WP10017","armor":"WP1031705","helmet":"WP1012802","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;4/1;10/1;11/1;18/1;40/1;61/1;30/0;36/0;69/0","father":"WJ1016